OL,4,BPochettino leads Man Utd fury at Yoro  
OL,5,Bred card ruling                        
OL,6,GManchester United head coach Mauricio  
OL,7,GPochettino has questioned the          
OL,8,Gcompetence of video assistant referee  
OL,9,Gofficials after defender Leny Yoro had 
OL,10,Ghis red card overturned by the         
OL,11,GFootball Association.                  
OL,13,FYoro was sent off eight minutes into   
OL,14,FUnited's 4-0 defeat at Liverpool on    
OL,15,FSunday after bringing down Aleksander  
OL,16,FIsak just outside the United penalty   
OL,17,Farea.                                  
